WEBVTT

00:00:30.068 --> 00:00:33.029
And even today,
when deciding where to sit,

00:00:33.071 --> 00:00:35.656
how many of you
chose to sit next to someone

00:00:35.656 --> 00:00:38.993
who looked or felt different from you?

00:00:39.577 --> 00:00:42.455
I would bet that not many of you did that.

00:00:42.872 --> 00:00:45.500
I guess not much changes
in some situations,

00:00:45.541 --> 00:00:48.503
whether you're 17 or you're 70.

00:00:49.504 --> 00:00:54.050
We've all likely felt this tendency
to gravitate towards people who look,

00:00:54.050 --> 00:00:55.635
think and act like us.

00:00:55.635 --> 00:00:59.555
It's comfortable,
but it can also be harmful

00:00:59.555 --> 00:01:02.517
because this polarization
that we face today